 "base_case": "pj_owner_closes",
 "mutation": "drop:R3",
 "requirements": "Projects have members (project_members). Members see the tasks of their projects and may add tasks to them. A task may be assigned to a user, who must be a member of the task's project; only the assignee may update a task, and it stays in a project the assignee belongs to. Nobody deletes tasks. Additionally a project owner (owners are recorded in task_owners and must be members of the project) may delete tasks of their project.",
 "expected_properties": [
  "Tasks are only seen, added and changed by members of their project.",
  "Only the assignee updates a task.",
  "Leaving a project never grants access.",
  "An assignee is always a member of the task's project.",
  "Whatever is written can be read back.",
  "The application role may only select/insert/update/delete tasks and select project_members and projects.",
  "A member can read the tasks of their projects.",
  "A member can add an unassigned task to their project.",
  "An assignee can mark their task done.",
  "A project owner can delete any task of their project."
 ],
